## Task: Apply proper game juice to TownModal.svelte

Only modify `src/workbench/helpers/TownModal.svelte`. Do NOT touch any other file. IGNORE all build warnings.

### Problem
Current animations are too slow and don't have real squash/stretch. Hover transitions use `var(--transition)` (200ms) which feels sluggish. Need Disney-style squash/stretch with proper inverse scale axes and fast response times.

### Change 1: Add juicy keyframe animations after the existing keyframes
Add these new keyframes at the end of the `<style>` block, before `</style>`:

```css
  @keyframes pop-in {
    0% { transform: scale(0); opacity: 0; }
    50% { transform: scaleX(1.15) scaleY(0.85); }
    75% { transform: scaleX(0.95) scaleY(1.05); }
    100% { transform: scale(1); opacity: 1; }
  }

  @keyframes squash-click {
    0% { transform: scaleX(1) scaleY(1); }
    40% { transform: scaleX(1.2) scaleY(0.8); }
    70% { transform: scaleX(0.9) scaleY(1.1); }
    100% { transform: scaleX(1) scaleY(1); }
  }
```

### Change 2: Fix modal open animation — real squash/stretch
Replace the existing `@keyframes modal-card-in`:
```css
  @keyframes modal-card-in {
    0% { opacity: 0; transform: scale(0.5) scaleY(1.3); }
    40% { opacity: 1; transform: scaleX(1.08) scaleY(0.92); }
    65% { transform: scaleX(0.97) scaleY(1.03); }
    80% { transform: scaleX(1.01) scaleY(0.99); }
    100% { transform: scale(1); }
  }
```

### Change 3: Speed up ALL transition times
Replace every occurrence of `transition: all var(--transition);` with `transition: all 60ms ease-out;`
Replace every occurrence of `transition: background var(--transition);` with `transition: background 60ms ease-out;`
Replace every occurrence of `transition: color var(--transition);` with `transition: color 60ms ease-out;`
Replace `transition: all 0.1s ease;` with `transition: all 60ms ease-out;`
Replace `transition: border-color 0.1s, box-shadow 0.1s;` with `transition: border-color 60ms ease-out, box-shadow 60ms ease-out;`
Replace `transition: background 0.1s;` with `transition: background 60ms ease-out;`

### Change 4: Buttons use squash-click on active instead of just scale
Replace the existing active rule:
```css
  .buy-btn:active, .accept-btn:active, .upgrade-btn:active, .action-btn:active, .rest-btn:active {
    transform: scale(0.95);
  }
```
With:
```css
  .buy-btn:active, .accept-btn:active, .upgrade-btn:active, .action-btn:active, .rest-btn:active {
    animation: squash-click 150ms ease-out;
  }
```

### Change 5: Stash items pop in with staggered delay
In the template, change the stash slot div to include a pop animation for filled slots. Find:
```svelte
                <div class="stash-slot" class:filled={i < 4} style={i < 4 ? `color: ${stashItems[i].fg}` : ''} title={i < 4 ? stashItems[i].name : 'Empty'}>
```
Replace with:
```svelte
                <div class="stash-slot" class:filled={i < 4} style={i < 4 ? `color: ${stashItems[i].fg}; animation: pop-in 200ms ${i * 40}ms both ease-out` : ''} title={i < 4 ? stashItems[i].name : 'Empty'}>
```

### Change 6: Vendor items stagger in
Change the vendor `{#each}` to include index. Find:
```svelte
              {#each vendorItems as item}
                <li class="item-row">
```
Replace with:
```svelte
              {#each vendorItems as item, i}
                <li class="item-row" style="animation: pop-in 150ms {i * 30}ms both ease-out">
```

### Change 7: Quest entries stagger in
Find:
```svelte
              {#each quests as quest}
                <li class="quest-entry">
```
Replace with:
```svelte
              {#each quests as quest, i}
                <li class="quest-entry" style="animation: pop-in 150ms {i * 50}ms both ease-out">
```
